    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=={{ \"Customer Code: \" + $json.body.customer_code + \"\\nOrder ID: \" + $json.body.order_id + \"\\nName: \" + $json.body.name + \"\\nMessage: \" + $json.body.message + \"\\n\\nInstructions:\\nYou are a helpful AI Customer Support Agent. Your job is to process user requests, check database tables, and log complaints when necessary.\\n\\nFollow these strict rules based on the user's input and intent:\\n\\n1. UNDERSTAND THE INPUT:\\n   - Extract the user's `message`, `customer_code`, `order_id`, and `name` from the incoming request.\\n\\n2. IF THE USER IS ASKING ABOUT ORDER STATUS:\\n   - Query the `Customer Table` and `Orders Table` using the provided `customer_code` and `order_id`.\\n   - Retrieve the current order status and details.\\n   - Reply to the user with a clear summary of their order status and tracking details.\\n\\n3. IF THE USER IS RAISING A COMPLAINT / ISSUE:\\n   - Step 1: Query the `Support_Ticket Table` to check if a complaint already exists for this `order_id` or `customer_code`.\\n   - Step 2: \\n     * IF A COMPLAINT ALREADY EXISTS: Reply to the user with the status of their existing support ticket/complaint based on the `Support_Ticket Table` data.\\n     * IF NO COMPLAINT EXISTS: Call the `Complaint log` tool (Google Sheets) to record the new complaint with fields: `customer_code`, `order_id`, `name`, and `message`. Once successfully logged, reply to the user: \\\"We have received your complaint regarding order [order_id] and our team is actively working on it.\\\"\" }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": ""
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
